WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:03:08.290
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
03:08.560 --> 03:12.160
Aunt Liu, where is my dad?

3
03:12.880 --> 03:14.240
Your dad is dead.

4
03:14.320 --> 03:16.920
I lost both of my sons.

5
03:17.000 --> 03:19.800
Do you have any idea how much I lost?

6
03:20.320 --> 03:21.880
I don't agree with this at all.

7
03:21.960 --> 03:24.400
Bringing a poisonous snake this close to us?

8
03:24.480 --> 03:26.280
One day, it's going to bite.

9
03:26.880 --> 03:29.520
Why didn't you ask for ten or 20 million?

10
03:29.600 --> 03:32.520
You already stole so much money and jewelry from them.

11
03:32.600 --> 03:33.840
‎PREVIOUSLY

12
03:34.520 --> 03:36.840
You're about to learn that a construction worker's life

13
03:36.920 --> 03:38.560
isn't as easy as you think.

14
03:43.600 --> 03:46.200
I haven't held 500,000 baht in ages.

15
03:46.280 --> 03:47.520
My hands are shaking.

16
04:11.080 --> 04:13.080
Don't you dare, or I'll--

17
04:13.600 --> 04:14.800
Mom!

18
04:14.880 --> 04:16.200
Yeah, it's me.

19
04:17.240 --> 04:19.160
Why are you following me?

20
04:19.240 --> 04:22.360
I'm afraid you'll take the money Hathaya sent and gamble it away.

21
04:24.200 --> 04:27.400
-You know about that? -I'm not stupid.

22
04:28.200 --> 04:30.320
I heard everything. I know what's going on.

23
04:31.080 --> 04:33.640
Give me the money. I'll pay them back myself.

24
04:34.360 --> 04:37.640
Mom, I'm the one who borrowed from them.

25
04:37.720 --> 04:40.520
I have to take responsibility. I'll pay them back myself.

26
04:40.600 --> 04:42.000
Then I'm coming with you.

27
04:42.080 --> 04:46.120
Come on, Mom. I've learned my lesson too.

28
04:46.200 --> 04:49.440
I'm terrified those guys will gut me alive.

29
04:49.520 --> 04:51.960
You don't have to come. I'll pay them back myself.

30
04:52.040 --> 04:53.760
If you're determined to pay them back,

31
04:53.840 --> 04:55.760
then I'm determined to go with you.

32
04:57.920 --> 04:59.920
Fine, fine. If you don't trust me,

33
05:00.000 --> 05:02.200
then come with me. Come on.

34
05:03.240 --> 05:05.360
Motorcycle! Stop!

35
05:06.040 --> 05:07.400
I'm going, Mom.

36
05:07.480 --> 05:09.120
-Hey! -Go.

37
05:09.200 --> 05:11.760
-Go! -Wait for me, Hathai!

38
05:12.760 --> 05:14.120
Hathai, please!

39
05:15.520 --> 05:16.680
Please

40
05:17.200 --> 05:19.760
don't let Hathai go gambling again.

41
05:20.280 --> 05:21.840
Please.

42
05:22.680 --> 05:24.000
For goodness' sake!

43
05:39.000 --> 05:40.920
Come. You can get down now.

44
05:45.240 --> 05:46.560
What are you laughing at?

45
05:46.640 --> 05:49.480
Look at you. You look like a madwoman.

46
05:50.440 --> 05:52.760
Come on. Get down.

47
05:53.520 --> 05:54.480
Hurry.

48
05:58.920 --> 06:00.600
I'm definitely going to help Grandpa.

49
06:03.720 --> 06:07.840
Wait. Come here. Where are you going?

50
06:07.920 --> 06:09.440
To the office.

51
06:09.520 --> 06:10.840
No.

52
06:11.400 --> 06:13.720
Your workplace is over there.

53
06:23.080 --> 06:24.960
You want me to do construction work?

54
06:25.560 --> 06:26.520
Yes.

55
06:27.760 --> 06:30.720
And remember the most important rule.

56
06:31.600 --> 06:33.920
You're working here as a laborer.

57
06:34.000 --> 06:36.440
If you tell anyone that you're Mr. Pichai's granddaughter,

58
06:37.440 --> 06:39.320
the agreement you made with him

59
06:39.840 --> 06:41.280
becomes null and void.

60
06:52.000 --> 06:55.600
Everyone! Gather over here!

61
06:58.080 --> 06:59.400
Come on!

62
07:01.080 --> 07:04.400
The boss brought us a new worker today.

63
07:04.480 --> 07:06.360
Hello. My name is Hathaya.

64
07:06.440 --> 07:08.600
Hello. I'm Max.

65
07:08.680 --> 07:09.520
Pleasure.

66
07:09.600 --> 07:11.480
-Nice to meet you. -Alright.

67
07:11.560 --> 07:13.320
I work under Ramil.

68
07:15.000 --> 07:15.960
I see.

69
07:16.480 --> 07:17.520
All right, everyone.

70
07:18.480 --> 07:21.040
This is our new worker. She starts today.

71
07:22.080 --> 07:24.160
-Hello. My name is Hathaya-- -All right, go!

72
07:24.920 --> 07:27.200
Back to work. Get it done. Go team!

73
07:31.920 --> 07:32.920
Get moving.

74
07:34.040 --> 07:34.880
Come on! Hurry!

75
07:35.800 --> 07:37.040
Keep it moving!

76
07:37.680 --> 07:40.000
I didn't even get to introduce myself.

77
07:40.080 --> 07:41.120
Why?

78
07:41.200 --> 07:44.080
Will knowing their full names and home addresses

79
07:44.720 --> 07:46.000
make the work get done faster?

80
07:46.760 --> 07:48.160
You have no manners.

81
07:49.560 --> 07:52.240
Go work. Carry that cement over there and plaster the building.

82
07:52.320 --> 07:53.800
I've never done it before.

83
08:00.720 --> 08:01.560
Go over there.

84
08:02.760 --> 08:03.960
Go.

85
08:04.560 --> 08:06.560
Wait. Take two.

86
08:07.320 --> 08:08.640
Hurry up. No slacking.

87
09:22.880 --> 09:24.040
Think she can handle it?

88
09:25.800 --> 09:27.160
She has to.

89
09:27.760 --> 09:30.080
No slacking on this job.

90
09:31.480 --> 09:32.400
Nice.

91
09:34.720 --> 09:36.920
-Still? -What do you mean, still?

92
09:37.520 --> 09:39.560
You're still here? I said no slacking.

93
09:39.640 --> 09:42.040
-Go! Yeah, you! -Me?

94
09:42.120 --> 09:44.320
-No slacking. -Is that the right way?

95
09:44.840 --> 09:47.280
No slacking! No slacking!

96
09:52.800 --> 09:53.960
Let's see how long

97
09:55.480 --> 09:57.160
this pampered rich girl lasts.

98
09:59.600 --> 10:01.840
Having you around really saves me money.

99
10:01.920 --> 10:03.680
I don't even have to go to the nail salon.

100
10:04.960 --> 10:06.920
-Be gentle! -Yes, ma'am.

101
10:07.000 --> 10:09.440
Madam. You get your nails done

102
10:09.520 --> 10:13.200
about twice a week.

103
10:13.720 --> 10:16.920
Over a whole year,

104
10:17.000 --> 10:20.960
I must save you thousands, maybe even tens of thousands of baht.

105
10:21.040 --> 10:23.520
Don't start holding it over my head.

106
10:23.600 --> 10:25.680
I never make anyone work for free.

107
10:42.880 --> 10:44.840
Twenty baht?

108
10:44.920 --> 10:48.080
Madam, my heart is so full.

109
10:48.600 --> 10:50.000
A whole 20 baht!

110
10:50.520 --> 10:53.120
Go on. Get out of here.

111
10:53.200 --> 10:56.880
Just looking at your face makes my heart sink.

112
10:56.960 --> 10:57.880
Yes, ma'am.

113
10:58.600 --> 11:00.360
Mine is very, very full.

114
11:00.440 --> 11:01.960
My heart is overflowing.

115
11:02.480 --> 11:04.360
-Twenty baht? -Go.

116
11:05.640 --> 11:07.080
Yes, ma'am.

117
11:07.840 --> 11:09.560
Where's Hathaya?

118
11:09.640 --> 11:12.640
I haven't seen her at all this morning.

119
11:13.240 --> 11:16.520
Grandpa sent her to work at the construction site.

120
11:16.600 --> 11:19.880
I love it. By now, she's probably passed out

121
11:19.960 --> 11:22.720
face-first into a tub of cement.

122
11:23.720 --> 11:25.720
Working around construction workers?

123
11:25.800 --> 11:28.120
A few days and she'll probably end up with a husband.

124
11:29.480 --> 11:32.440
-By the way, who came to pick her up? -That lunatic Ramil.

125
11:33.480 --> 11:34.640
Ramil?

126
11:35.240 --> 11:36.600
You still miss him?

127
11:37.320 --> 11:38.480
Mom.

128
11:38.560 --> 11:42.400
Someone like me would never lower myself to be with someone like him.

129
11:42.480 --> 11:45.080
A parasite like him

130
11:45.160 --> 11:47.840
belongs with that parasite Hathaya.

131
11:47.920 --> 11:49.880
Then they can have a whole family of parasites.

132
11:52.040 --> 11:55.440
Where do you come up with this stuff? You're hilarious.

133
11:55.520 --> 11:56.760
Family of parasites?

134
12:00.120 --> 12:01.600
You're hilarious.

135
12:02.640 --> 12:05.840
It's noon, everyone! Take a break!

136
12:05.920 --> 12:07.160
Come on!

137
12:08.120 --> 12:09.280
Go eat!

138
12:10.360 --> 12:11.800
Come on.

139
12:15.120 --> 12:16.360
Let's go.

140
12:17.760 --> 12:20.640
-Where are you going? -To eat.

141
12:20.720 --> 12:23.320
I didn't bring any food. There should be a food stall nearby.

142
12:24.080 --> 12:25.720
-You can't go. Your work isn't done. -Huh?

143
12:25.800 --> 12:27.960
But I already poured all that cement for you.

144
12:28.040 --> 12:31.520
And you're going to let the cement dry onto the buckets? Wash them first.

145
12:31.600 --> 12:33.760
I'll help her. It'll get done faster.

146
12:33.840 --> 12:36.560
-No. -I just want to help.

147
12:37.400 --> 12:38.440
I said no.

148
12:40.520 --> 12:41.360
Okay!

149
12:41.440 --> 12:43.200
No, no, no.

150
12:44.120 --> 12:45.760
Hang in there. I'm starving!

151
12:49.440 --> 12:53.440
Go wash the cement buckets. And make sure they're completely clean.

152
12:54.320 --> 12:56.680
If I see even a trace of cement left on them,

153
12:57.640 --> 12:58.880
you don't get to eat.

154
13:01.720 --> 13:02.760
Go.

155
13:21.080 --> 13:22.160
Thanks.

156
13:28.720 --> 13:30.040
Come to think of it,

157
13:30.680 --> 13:32.920
that new worker looks really familiar.

158
13:33.000 --> 13:34.760
I swear I've seen her somewhere before.

159
13:36.200 --> 13:37.600
She's Mr. Pichai's granddaughter.

160
13:40.040 --> 13:41.160
His granddaughter?

161
13:49.240 --> 13:52.080
Then why are you making her work out here in the sun and wind?

162
13:53.360 --> 13:56.560
Remember that story people used to tell?

163
13:56.640 --> 13:58.240
The eldest daughter-in-law

164
13:58.320 --> 14:02.160
was caught having an affair, then ran away with her daughter and the money.

165
14:02.240 --> 14:04.200
And because of that, both his sons ended up dead.

166
14:04.920 --> 14:06.040
That granddaughter?

167
14:06.640 --> 14:09.320
She disappeared for more than ten years, then suddenly came back.

168
14:09.840 --> 14:13.240
So Mr. Pichai is convinced she came back for the inheritance.

169
14:15.200 --> 14:17.880
Still, that doesn't seem fair.

170
14:18.560 --> 14:20.720
Her mother might have been unfaithful,

171
14:21.240 --> 14:23.240
but you can't blame her for her mother's actions.

172
14:27.040 --> 14:28.800
I hate to judge people like that too.

173
14:30.400 --> 14:32.520
But what can I do? I was given orders.

174
14:35.600 --> 14:38.560
And don't tell anyone about this. Understand?

175
14:39.160 --> 14:41.720
I promise. My lips are sealed.

176
15:17.560 --> 15:21.400
I've got 500,000. If I can make another 500,000,

177
15:24.680 --> 15:26.760
I'll have enough money to pay for Mom's treatment.

178
15:28.440 --> 15:32.480
Hathaya, you won't have to keep working until the end of the month anymore.

179
15:40.120 --> 15:41.440
Hi.

180
16:53.240 --> 16:55.880
Damn it, Aow. He forgot his bag again.

181
17:00.040 --> 17:01.360
Boss, who are you looking for?

182
17:03.400 --> 17:04.319
Where is she?

183
17:05.920 --> 17:08.839
She? Who?

184
17:09.920 --> 17:12.359
Good one? Bad one?

185
17:19.319 --> 17:20.680
Why'd you hit me?

186
17:21.319 --> 17:23.920
She probably went to get something to eat.

187
17:28.280 --> 17:29.760
Break time is over.

188
17:30.720 --> 17:33.640
Is she trying to slack off and test me?

189
17:36.360 --> 17:38.960
I have a card! I have a card!

190
17:39.040 --> 17:42.000
-Without ID, you're going to jail. -I'm not going.

191
17:42.080 --> 17:44.600
-You're coming with us. -What are you doing?

192
17:45.640 --> 17:46.680
What's going on?

193
17:46.760 --> 17:48.840
None of your business. Stay out of it.

194
17:49.440 --> 17:52.240
He's my friend. We work at the same place.

195
17:54.000 --> 17:55.640
So you're a migrant worker too?

196
17:55.720 --> 17:58.680
Your Thai is pretty good. I bet you don't have an ID either.

197
17:59.200 --> 18:00.520
Want to come to the station?

198
18:07.120 --> 18:08.560
If you don't want to go to jail,

199
18:10.000 --> 18:13.120
sleep with me, and I'll let you go.

200
18:14.800 --> 18:16.080
I'm Thai.

201
18:16.720 --> 18:18.200
You should've said so.

202
18:19.120 --> 18:21.160
Go back to work. Stay out of this.

203
18:21.240 --> 18:24.200
I already told you. He's my friend.

204
18:24.280 --> 18:25.760
What are you arresting him for?

205
18:25.840 --> 18:28.120
He's a migrant worker without his ID card.

206
18:28.200 --> 18:30.200
My card is at the construction site.

207
18:30.280 --> 18:32.000
I said I'd go back and get it,

208
18:32.080 --> 18:33.720
but they won't let me.

209
18:35.280 --> 18:37.520
No ID means he broke the law. He has to pay a fine.

210
18:37.600 --> 18:40.120
I don't have money to pay.

211
18:40.200 --> 18:41.600
He said if I give him my gold chain,

212
18:41.680 --> 18:44.240
I won't have to go to jail.

213
18:44.320 --> 18:45.840
How can you do that?

214
18:45.920 --> 18:48.400
Do what? I'm just enforcing the law.

215
18:48.480 --> 18:50.240
If you're really enforcing the law,

216
18:50.320 --> 18:53.840
then you should take him to the station and have his employer pay the fine.

217
18:53.920 --> 18:56.720
Instead, you threatened him and tried to take his gold chain.

218
18:57.240 --> 18:59.400
Are you a police officer or a thief?

219
18:59.480 --> 19:02.040
Talking to me like that is an insult.

220
19:02.120 --> 19:03.600
I'll make sure you're prosecuted.

221
19:03.680 --> 19:06.800
And what about when you called me a migrant worker

222
19:06.880 --> 19:09.800
and told me to sleep with you in exchange for letting me go?

223
19:09.880 --> 19:11.200
Is that legal?

224
19:15.880 --> 19:17.440
I recorded everything.

225
19:17.960 --> 19:19.920
And I'll make sure you're held accountable too.

226
19:20.000 --> 19:21.680
Wait, wait.

227
19:22.480 --> 19:25.360
Calm down. You're Thai just like us.

228
19:25.880 --> 19:27.440
I'll apologize on behalf of him.

229
19:27.520 --> 19:28.840
No ID. Still illegal.

230
19:28.920 --> 19:31.160
Strictly speaking, yes.

231
19:31.240 --> 19:33.800
He was wrong not to carry his ID card.

232
19:34.400 --> 19:37.040
But as one human being to another,

233
19:37.560 --> 19:40.320
you could let him go back to the site and bring the it to you.

234
19:40.400 --> 19:41.920
It wouldn't take that much time.

235
19:42.000 --> 19:43.880
You say you're enforcing the law,

236
19:43.960 --> 19:45.840
but you're breaking it yourself.

237
19:46.440 --> 19:47.920
Why do you even care?

238
19:48.000 --> 19:49.720
He's just a migrant worker.

239
19:50.880 --> 19:53.760
You have no right to point at anyone and call them a parasite.

240
19:53.840 --> 19:56.280
He came here to work legally.

241
19:56.360 --> 19:59.840
You know perfectly well that many Thai people don't want to do manual labor

242
19:59.920 --> 20:01.720
unless the wages are high.

243
20:01.800 --> 20:04.960
You should be thanking them for coming here and helping us.

244
20:05.640 --> 20:07.280
And if anyone is a parasite

245
20:07.360 --> 20:09.280
like you say,

246
20:09.960 --> 20:11.320
it's people like you.

247
20:11.400 --> 20:13.880
You're the parasites of the police force.

248
20:13.960 --> 20:14.960
I'll slap your mouth!

249
20:16.360 --> 20:17.560
Why are you getting involved?

250
20:18.200 --> 20:19.680
I'm their boss.

251
20:22.080 --> 20:24.120
Here are their cards.

252
20:26.200 --> 20:27.880
They work for Mr. Pichai.

253
20:28.480 --> 20:30.600
Mr. Pichai? The owner of the big development project?

254
20:30.680 --> 20:32.640
You know Mr. Pichai

255
20:32.720 --> 20:34.400
never employs illegal workers.

256
20:35.440 --> 20:38.160
He also supports activities at your police station.

257
20:38.920 --> 20:41.200
If you keep acting outside the law like this,

258
20:42.280 --> 20:44.120
I may have to call your superior.

259
20:44.880 --> 20:47.680
Come on. It was just a misunderstanding.

260
20:48.480 --> 20:50.120
Carry your card with you next time.

261
20:53.360 --> 20:54.840
I apologize for my friend.

262
20:55.360 --> 20:57.560
It won't happen again.

263
21:03.800 --> 21:05.720
Thank you so much, boss.

264
21:05.800 --> 21:08.240
If you hadn't helped me, I would've been in trouble.

265
21:08.320 --> 21:11.120
Thank you. Thank you so much.

266
21:11.880 --> 21:14.640
It's okay. We should help each other.

267
21:14.720 --> 21:16.720
Make sure you carry your ID with you from now.

268
21:17.280 --> 21:18.960
And save up your money

269
21:19.040 --> 21:21.080
so you can go home. Your parents are waiting.

270
21:22.000 --> 21:25.000
Thank you. Thank you so much.

271
22:04.320 --> 22:05.240
Hey.

272
22:06.640 --> 22:09.320
Next time, don't act so tough and reckless like that. It's dangerous.

273
22:09.960 --> 22:12.480
I'm not scared. I have my phone.

274
22:15.240 --> 22:16.960
Give me my phone back.

275
22:19.160 --> 22:22.240
You can't even protect one little phone.

276
22:22.320 --> 22:23.400
Here.

277
22:24.720 --> 22:27.800
Corrupt people like that can use their authority and physical force against you.

278
22:28.360 --> 22:31.120
Think before you do something.

279
22:31.880 --> 22:33.520
Make sure you can protect yourself first.

280
22:34.240 --> 22:36.280
I can't stand watching people get taken advantage of.

281
22:37.320 --> 22:40.160
When I lived in Ranong, I knew a lot of people like them.

282
22:40.240 --> 22:42.760
They have to cross borders and travel so far

283
22:42.840 --> 22:45.520
just to work here and earn money for their parents and families.

284
22:46.480 --> 22:49.240
They struggle for every single baht.

285
22:49.320 --> 22:51.280
They endure exhaustion and all kinds of abuse.

286
22:51.800 --> 22:54.560
A lot of them get extorted by corrupt police officers.

287
22:55.280 --> 22:58.120
Some have to pay thousands of baht just to make it here for work.

288
22:58.760 --> 23:00.880
No one wants to be born into a life of hardship.

289
23:01.400 --> 23:02.960
They just don't have a choice.

290
23:03.720 --> 23:04.800
I'm no different from them.

291
23:10.400 --> 23:12.360
If I were a supervisor like you,

292
23:13.360 --> 23:15.640
I'd choose to protect my workers

293
23:15.720 --> 23:17.520
instead of criticizing me for what I did.

294
23:28.000 --> 23:29.400
What are you doing?

295
23:29.480 --> 23:33.040
You're just a worker. What right do you have to lecture me?

296
23:35.280 --> 23:38.200
You hate seeing people get taken advantage of, right?

297
23:38.280 --> 23:39.520
Then,

298
23:40.640 --> 23:42.360
you shouldn't take advantage of anyone.

299
23:43.440 --> 23:44.360
Look over there.

300
23:48.840 --> 23:50.200
Get back to work.

301
23:54.760 --> 23:58.120
I was glad when you stepped in to help.

302
23:59.400 --> 24:01.280
I thought you were a good supervisor.

303
24:01.920 --> 24:03.320
But now I know

304
24:04.200 --> 24:05.960
you're not as good as I thought.

305
24:06.680 --> 24:10.400
You only helped because you wanted to act tough in front of the police.

306
24:25.360 --> 24:28.040
Boss, you're seriously cold-blooded.

307
24:28.120 --> 24:29.640
That was brutal.

308
24:33.160 --> 24:34.360
It has to be this way.

309
24:36.000 --> 24:37.760
I'm following Mr. Pichai's orders.

310
24:39.480 --> 24:42.640
He wants me to test if this woman really has the determination

311
24:43.560 --> 24:44.680
or if she's just all talk.

312
24:45.920 --> 24:48.080
My sweet, kind-hearted boss

313
24:48.160 --> 24:50.480
has turned into a maniac again.

314
24:58.560 --> 24:59.600
I got this.

315
25:09.080 --> 25:11.360
Everyone! That's it for today!

316
25:12.200 --> 25:14.960
Go on! See you tomorrow!

317
25:17.920 --> 25:19.480
Come on, everybody!

318
25:39.920 --> 25:41.840
Madam! Madam!

319
25:42.800 --> 25:43.640
Hey!

320
25:44.240 --> 25:47.040
Stop screaming! You're going to burst my eardrums.

321
25:47.120 --> 25:47.960
What is it?

322
25:48.560 --> 25:52.040
Madam, that shameless woman's daughter is back.

323
25:52.120 --> 25:52.960
Really?

324
25:53.680 --> 25:55.480
So? She's dead, right?

325
25:56.600 --> 25:59.000
She's not dead, but she looks half-dead, ma'am.

326
26:01.040 --> 26:03.040
Then let's finish the job.

327
26:17.640 --> 26:18.480
Wait.

328
26:20.640 --> 26:23.120
Hello. I'm back.

329
26:24.720 --> 26:27.320
Look at you. Can you handle it?

330
26:27.840 --> 26:31.080
If you can't, I can give you enough money for the trip home.

331
26:31.840 --> 26:33.000
I can handle it.

332
26:34.720 --> 26:37.280
I'll be going now.

333
26:39.520 --> 26:40.960
Where are you going?

334
26:41.560 --> 26:43.360
Back to my room to rest.

335
26:43.440 --> 26:47.640
Did you forget your place when Father

336
26:47.720 --> 26:49.120
let you stay in this house?

337
26:51.480 --> 26:55.360
There. Wash all those dishes until they're spotless.

338
26:56.040 --> 26:57.440
When you're done, mop the floors.

339
27:00.000 --> 27:00.920
Okay.

340
27:01.000 --> 27:02.000
Oh.

341
27:02.680 --> 27:06.520
Goodness. You must be exhausted after working so hard.

342
27:06.600 --> 27:09.640
I completely forgot to ask. Have you eaten anything yet?

343
27:10.920 --> 27:12.240
Not yet.

344
27:13.920 --> 27:17.360
Well, I am your aunt by marriage.

345
27:17.440 --> 27:20.920
I wouldn't be so heartless to my own family.

346
27:21.440 --> 27:23.160
-Chamoi -Yes?

347
27:23.240 --> 27:25.160
saved some food for you.

348
27:26.320 --> 27:28.280
Thank you very much, Aunt Liu.

349
27:30.280 --> 27:31.600
-Chamoi. -Yes?

350
27:32.240 --> 27:33.960
Bring my niece her food.

351
27:34.680 --> 27:35.800
Of course.

352
27:36.920 --> 27:40.080
Hurry up. My niece is hungry.

353
27:46.800 --> 27:49.200
Madam, I'm so sorry. I don't know what happened.

354
27:49.280 --> 27:52.080
My hands suddenly went weak.

355
27:52.760 --> 27:54.280
What a mess.

356
27:54.960 --> 27:59.640
If you want anything to eat, I guess you'll have to make it yourself.

357
27:59.720 --> 28:03.880
But you need to finish all your work first.

358
28:03.960 --> 28:05.160
Then you can cook something.

359
28:13.960 --> 28:17.520
Oh, what a shame. Sorry. Looks like you'll have to make your own food.

360
28:17.600 --> 28:21.680
But you have to finish all your work first before you get to eat.

361
28:37.720 --> 28:40.440
Hathaya did everything I told her to do today.

362
28:44.360 --> 28:46.200
No matter how hard I pushed her,

363
28:47.760 --> 28:50.880
Hathaya never complained. She didn't abandon the work either.

364
28:51.560 --> 28:55.120
Also, one of our workers was extorted by corrupt police officers today.

365
28:56.480 --> 28:58.560
Hathaya stepped in to protect him

366
29:00.000 --> 29:01.120
without any fear.

367
29:06.080 --> 29:08.040
She stood up for him completely.

368
29:08.960 --> 29:10.320
She wasn't afraid of them at all.

369
29:12.120 --> 29:15.040
Then I warned her to be careful

370
29:15.120 --> 29:16.720
and not put herself in danger.

371
29:18.240 --> 29:19.360
But she wouldn't listen.

372
29:19.960 --> 29:22.600
She insisted on doing what she believed was right.

373
29:22.680 --> 29:25.240
She trusted the evidence and the truth.

374
29:26.720 --> 29:28.520
And on top of that,

375
29:29.360 --> 29:31.760
she even criticized me for trying to stop her.

376
29:32.440 --> 29:34.960
Exactly as I thought.

377
29:36.400 --> 29:39.920
She's stubborn and always has to win, just like her mother.

378
29:40.000 --> 29:42.240
No matter how good I tried to be,

379
29:42.320 --> 29:45.440
you never once opened your heart to accept me.

380
29:45.520 --> 29:49.760
That's why you did everything you could

381
29:50.280 --> 29:52.480
to keep me away from Burapha.

382
29:54.720 --> 29:57.400
Her mother filled her head with the same rotten ideas.

383
29:58.000 --> 29:59.200
Always blaming other people.

384
30:00.520 --> 30:03.960
What would you like me to do next, sir?

385
30:04.560 --> 30:07.040
Take Hathaya back to the construction site.

386
30:08.280 --> 30:11.280
Make her do everything the other laborers do.

387
30:15.320 --> 30:16.800
But I don't think

388
30:17.960 --> 30:20.040
Hathaya will be able to keep this up.

389
30:20.960 --> 30:22.720
It might be better to let her work

390
30:23.280 --> 30:24.800
in the office instead, sir.

391
30:25.920 --> 30:26.960
No.

392
30:28.560 --> 30:31.520
That woman is arrogant.

393
30:32.200 --> 30:35.040
I want to see how long she can last.

394
30:39.560 --> 30:40.560
Yes, sir.

395
30:53.720 --> 30:56.000
-Your food's ready. -How much?

396
30:56.080 --> 30:57.160
One hundred baht.

397
30:57.240 --> 30:58.280
See you.

398
30:58.360 --> 30:59.760
-Thank you. -Bye.

399
31:06.560 --> 31:10.480
Oh, Hathai. She still hasn't come back.

400
31:11.000 --> 31:13.400
By now, she's probably gambled all the money away.

401
31:15.120 --> 31:17.080
And if those debt collectors show up,

402
31:17.160 --> 31:19.080
where am I supposed to find money to pay them?

403
31:25.560 --> 31:28.960
I don't have any money. I really don't have any.

404
31:29.040 --> 31:30.640
Please don't hurt me.

405
31:30.720 --> 31:32.480
Mom. It's me.

406
31:34.320 --> 31:37.000
Hathai! That's not funny!

407
31:37.080 --> 31:38.480
You scared me half to death.

408
31:39.960 --> 31:40.880
Where's the money?

409
31:41.720 --> 31:44.520
You gambled it all away, didn't you?

410
31:44.600 --> 31:46.600
So now what are we going to do?

411
31:46.680 --> 31:48.720
Where are we supposed to get money to pay the debt?

412
31:48.800 --> 31:50.240
-Mom. -Let me see.

413
31:50.320 --> 31:51.760
-What? -Let me see it!

414
31:51.840 --> 31:54.160
Mom! Don't worry.

415
31:54.240 --> 31:56.440
It's not even due yet.

416
31:56.520 --> 31:57.440
Listen.

417
31:58.200 --> 32:00.520
Then you need to hide somewhere for a while.

418
32:00.600 --> 32:03.360
Otherwise, those people are going to kill you.

419
32:03.440 --> 32:05.600
Why should I hide, Mom?

420
32:06.240 --> 32:07.600
Mom,

421
32:07.680 --> 32:09.840
if they show up,

422
32:13.080 --> 32:16.200
I'll smack them in the mouth with this money.

423
32:19.560 --> 32:21.240
Where did you get that much money?

424
32:21.760 --> 32:22.920
Did you steal it?

425
32:23.920 --> 32:27.600
Keep your voice down. Someone might hear you and rob us.

426
32:27.680 --> 32:29.560
Where did you get it?

427
32:29.640 --> 32:32.040
I took the money Hathaya gave me

428
32:32.120 --> 32:34.080
and invested it last night.

429
32:34.160 --> 32:38.120
I played cards all night and won another 300,000, Mom.

430
32:38.200 --> 32:41.360
So now we've got 800,000.

431
32:44.160 --> 32:47.880
Good. Then go pay them right away so this can finally be over.

432
32:48.680 --> 32:51.560
Why do I have to rush? It's not due yet.

433
32:52.200 --> 32:54.240
Just hurry up and pay it.

434
32:54.320 --> 32:56.200
Then your daughter won't have to worry anymore.

435
32:56.280 --> 32:59.120
Mom. Just let me

436
32:59.200 --> 33:02.600
sleep with it and kiss it

437
33:02.680 --> 33:04.040
a little longer.

438
33:04.120 --> 33:07.120
I haven't seen this much money in ages.

439
33:09.320 --> 33:12.520
I played all night. I'm exhausted.

440
33:12.600 --> 33:14.040
I'm going to bed.

441
33:17.640 --> 33:21.640
Once the debt is paid off, Hathaya can finally come home.

442
33:22.920 --> 33:24.640
Hang in there a little longer.

443
33:47.040 --> 33:49.320
Grandpa, don't come down yet!

444
33:49.400 --> 33:50.680
Why, sweetheart?

445
33:50.760 --> 33:54.600
Aunt Chamoi mopped the floor but didn't dry it. You might slip.

446
34:03.840 --> 34:06.680
Hold onto the railing, Grandpa. And come down slowly.

447
34:36.719 --> 34:38.679
You're safe now, Grandpa.

448
34:42.760 --> 34:45.080
Your knees are all red. Does it hurt?

449
34:46.040 --> 34:47.040
Yes.

450
34:47.120 --> 34:50.000
If your knees hurt, why are you still wiping the floor?

451
34:50.080 --> 34:52.120
Because I'm worried about you, Grandpa.

452
34:54.239 --> 34:56.360
My beloved Hathaya.

453
34:56.440 --> 34:58.360
I love Grandpa more than anyone in the world too.

454
34:58.440 --> 35:00.200
That makes Grandpa so happy.

455
35:11.360 --> 35:12.240
Grandpa,

456
35:13.080 --> 35:15.520
I've wiped the floor clean and dry.

457
35:15.600 --> 35:19.040
If you're coming down, please hold onto the railing so you don't fall.

458
35:20.800 --> 35:22.360
I'm not some old, sick man

459
35:22.440 --> 35:24.960
who needs someone to take care of me.

460
35:25.880 --> 35:27.360
I can take care of myself.

461
35:29.600 --> 35:31.960
And don't think doing a few good deeds is going to soften me.

462
35:33.760 --> 35:35.360
I'm not stupid enough

463
35:35.440 --> 35:37.440
to let anyone fool me that easily.

464
35:38.640 --> 35:39.600
Grandpa!

465
35:41.840 --> 35:42.880
Are you okay? Grandpa?

466
35:49.840 --> 35:51.320
Father!

467
35:53.960 --> 35:56.320
Father, are you all right?

468
35:57.040 --> 35:57.960
I'm fine.

469
35:58.040 --> 36:00.800
What did you do to Father?

470
36:02.040 --> 36:05.240
I didn't do anything. Grandpa was about to fall, so I helped him.

471
36:05.320 --> 36:07.800
Father fell because of you.

472
36:12.040 --> 36:15.800
Good grief. Did you even attempt to mop this? The floor is soaking wet.

473
36:15.880 --> 36:19.520
If Father had fallen down the stairs and ended up disabled, what would you do?

474
36:22.560 --> 36:24.640
Or were you trying to hurt him?

475
36:25.440 --> 36:28.480
No. I wiped the floor completely dry.

476
36:28.560 --> 36:30.880
Check it if you don't believe me. There's no water left.

477
36:38.240 --> 36:40.480
It really is wet! Oh, my goodness!

478
36:41.080 --> 36:43.480
Don't worry, sir.

479
36:43.560 --> 36:45.280
I'll wipe it completely dry for you.

480
36:45.800 --> 36:47.680
You always have an answer for everything.

481
36:48.200 --> 36:50.360
It's not time for you to go to the construction site yet?

482
36:50.440 --> 36:53.640
Then go work in the kitchen.

483
37:07.080 --> 37:08.800
Father,

484
37:08.880 --> 37:11.760
you really have to be more careful.

485
37:12.320 --> 37:15.080
I don't trust Hathaya at all.

486
37:21.680 --> 37:23.560
What do you mean by that?

487
37:25.360 --> 37:28.840
I'm afraid Hathaya might try to hurt you.

488
37:31.640 --> 37:33.880
And please don't think I'm trying to turn you against her.

489
37:33.960 --> 37:36.840
You know very well

490
37:36.920 --> 37:40.080
what Hathai did to us. She had an affair

491
37:40.160 --> 37:42.880
and humiliated you.

492
37:42.960 --> 37:46.480
Then she stole my jewelry and all that money too.

493
37:47.400 --> 37:49.760
That was Hathai, not Hathaya.

494
37:50.880 --> 37:53.480
I understand. But her mother

495
37:53.560 --> 37:56.600
must have filled her head with ideas about getting revenge on you.

496
37:57.240 --> 38:00.600
I don't trust her. I'm afraid she might try to hurt you.

497
38:01.560 --> 38:04.240
Father, I think you should

498
38:04.320 --> 38:06.640
just throw some money at her and get her out of here.

499
38:07.480 --> 38:09.280
Enough.

500
38:11.200 --> 38:14.680
I'm not stupid enough to let anyone fool me again.

501
38:15.200 --> 38:16.720
And besides,

502
38:19.080 --> 38:22.560
I gave her my word. I have to stand by what I said.

503
38:23.720 --> 38:26.440
Believe me. She won't last until the end of the month.

504
38:27.720 --> 38:28.600
All right.

505
38:30.280 --> 38:32.080
Father, from now on,

506
38:32.160 --> 38:35.800
whenever you go up or down the stairs, call me.

507
38:35.880 --> 38:38.640
Or call Chayanee to help you.

508
38:40.280 --> 38:41.320
Oh, right.

509
38:42.080 --> 38:45.720
Where is Chayanee? I haven't seen her for several days.

510
38:48.680 --> 38:49.560
Oh, well…

511
38:49.640 --> 38:53.360
Chayanee said she went on a trip with some old friends.

512
38:53.440 --> 38:55.480
She should be back in a day or two.

513
38:55.560 --> 38:59.040
But she video calls me every day.

514
38:59.120 --> 39:01.400
She keeps saying how much she misses you.

515
39:02.960 --> 39:05.840
When she gets back, tell her to come see me.

516
39:06.360 --> 39:09.120
I want to ask her about the marketing plan for the new development.

517
39:10.720 --> 39:11.600
Yes.

518
39:25.680 --> 39:27.640
I already told you, Mom.

519
39:27.720 --> 39:30.760
I want to be alone. I just want some time to relax.

520
39:30.840 --> 39:33.520
Stop acting so carefree, Chayanee.

521
39:34.120 --> 39:36.720
That manipulative Hathaya keeps hanging around Grandpa

522
39:36.800 --> 39:38.720
and trying to please him.

523
39:38.800 --> 39:41.320
Be careful. She's going to swoop in

524
39:41.400 --> 39:42.760
and steal your inheritance.

525
39:43.840 --> 39:45.320
Grandpa loves me.

526
39:45.400 --> 39:47.800
There's no way he'll give any of the inheritance to her.

527
39:47.880 --> 39:49.560
Don't underestimate her.

528
39:49.640 --> 39:53.000
Old people need even more attention and affection.

529
39:53.080 --> 39:54.640
You need to come back now.

530
39:54.720 --> 39:57.960
Grandpa asked about the marketing plan for the housing development,

531
39:58.040 --> 39:59.160
and I had no answer.

532
40:00.040 --> 40:01.560
Okay. I know.

533
40:01.640 --> 40:02.760
You're awake?

534
40:04.440 --> 40:06.120
Chayanee, where are you?

535
40:06.200 --> 40:07.320
Who are you with?

536
40:07.400 --> 40:09.640
I'm with a friend. Talk later, Mom.

537
40:13.760 --> 40:14.600
Chayanee--

538
40:18.920 --> 40:19.760
Madam,

539
40:19.840 --> 40:23.080
there's no point calling her. She won't answer anyway.

540
40:23.160 --> 40:24.480
Who is Chayanee with?

541
40:26.080 --> 40:26.920
Who is she with?

542
40:27.560 --> 40:30.080
That's what I'm asking! Who is she with?

543
40:30.640 --> 40:31.640
I heard a man's voice.

544
40:31.720 --> 40:32.800
A man?!

545
40:34.080 --> 40:34.920
‎Her husband!

546
40:35.000 --> 40:36.080
You idiot!

547
40:36.160 --> 40:39.200
She's still single. She doesn't even have a boyfriend, let alone husband.

548
40:39.280 --> 40:41.000
You never know these days, madam.

549
40:41.080 --> 40:43.440
Women today just don't care what anyone thinks.

550
40:44.080 --> 40:46.760
You really have a foul mouth.

551
40:47.640 --> 40:49.760
-Go! Get out! -Yes, ma'am!

552
40:58.000 --> 40:59.560
Smells so good.

553
41:00.520 --> 41:03.040
Do you mean the coffee or me?

554
41:05.640 --> 41:08.360
The coffee smells good, but you smell even better.

555
41:10.680 --> 41:11.800
Raiwin,

556
41:11.880 --> 41:15.680
how much longer are you going to keep our relationship a secret?

557
41:17.680 --> 41:20.840
Right now, Dad wants me to focus on work.

558
41:20.920 --> 41:23.440
And he wants me to run in the next election too.

559
41:24.280 --> 41:26.080
I don't think we can go public yet.

560
41:30.280 --> 41:31.920
You're not a child anymore.

561
41:32.000 --> 41:34.360
You need to have a mind of your own.

562
41:35.520 --> 41:39.400
Do you know how much the world has changed?

563
41:40.480 --> 41:44.200
If you let your girlfriend help you campaign,

564
41:44.280 --> 41:46.360
you could win support from younger voters too.

565
41:49.800 --> 41:52.040
I really did choose the right woman.

566
41:52.800 --> 41:54.720
All right.

567
41:54.800 --> 41:57.640
I'll talk to my father today. Okay?

568
41:58.240 --> 41:59.560
Okay.

569
42:13.400 --> 42:14.600
Ramil,

570
42:14.680 --> 42:17.080
have breakfast with me. I prepared delicious food for you.

571
42:18.960 --> 42:21.320
Mom, you usually have me eat at roadside stalls.

572
42:22.280 --> 42:25.440
What's special about today? Why did you invite me to the main house?

573
42:26.640 --> 42:28.320
We haven't eaten together in a long time.

574
42:28.400 --> 42:30.400
I just want to have a meal with you, okay?

575
42:30.480 --> 42:31.440
Come on.

576
42:32.720 --> 42:34.400
Come with me.

577
42:42.800 --> 42:44.640
Were you never taught manners?

578
42:45.680 --> 42:47.520
Why do you make your elders wait for you?

579
42:48.360 --> 42:51.120
Didn't your father ever teach you any manners?

580
42:53.040 --> 42:55.720
Ramil, come eat with us.

581
42:56.440 --> 42:57.600
Go sit down, sweetheart.

582
43:06.520 --> 43:09.520
I really don't want to sit at the same table with you.

583
43:11.640 --> 43:14.400
But today it's necessary. I have something to discuss with you.

584
43:16.360 --> 43:20.400
I want you to resign from Mr. Pichai's company

585
43:21.040 --> 43:22.880
and start a new company.

586
43:23.880 --> 43:26.680
You've worked with Mr. Pichai for a long time.

587
43:26.760 --> 43:28.400
You should know the system

588
43:28.480 --> 43:32.400
and have connections with suppliers and labor brokers.

589
43:33.960 --> 43:37.160
I want you to become your own boss.

590
43:37.680 --> 43:39.720
Stop working for someone else.

591
43:39.800 --> 43:41.680
Everything I'm saying

592
43:42.360 --> 43:44.600
is for your own benefit.

593
43:46.480 --> 43:47.880
Thank Mr. Saksit, sweetheart.

594
43:54.880 --> 43:56.120
Why me?

595
43:57.520 --> 44:00.280
Why not have Raiwin, your own biological son, do it?

596
44:00.360 --> 44:03.640
Raiwin is going to run for Subdistrict Chief in my place.

597
44:03.720 --> 44:06.720
As for you, you're not my son.

598
44:07.960 --> 44:10.120
So you need to set up the company

599
44:10.200 --> 44:12.200
and act as my nominee.

600
44:12.280 --> 44:14.280
Then we can take contracts from local government.

601
44:14.880 --> 44:16.080
What do I get?

602
44:18.440 --> 44:20.840
Someone like you gets a regular salary.

603
44:21.480 --> 44:25.480
And you'll receive 20%

604
44:25.560 --> 44:26.880
of the company's annual profit.

605
44:27.800 --> 44:28.640
I won't do it.

606
44:29.880 --> 44:30.920
Why?

607
44:31.000 --> 44:33.840
You want more? I'll give you 30%.

608
44:33.920 --> 44:35.160
I said I won't do it.

609
44:36.720 --> 44:38.480
You dare disobey me?

610
44:38.560 --> 44:40.840
Even if you gave me 100%,

611
44:42.440 --> 44:43.400
I still wouldn't do it.

612
44:44.360 --> 44:46.480
How dare you defy me!

613
44:46.560 --> 44:48.480
First of all,

614
44:49.440 --> 44:53.040
Mr. Pichai gave me an opportunity when I graduated.

615
44:53.560 --> 44:55.240
I will not betray him.

616
44:56.000 --> 44:58.440
And most importantly,

617
44:59.040 --> 45:02.240
I refuse to set up a nominee company to take public contracts.

618
45:03.320 --> 45:04.960
This country

619
45:05.040 --> 45:08.040
has already suffered enough because of corruption.

620
45:08.920 --> 45:12.360
I will never serve a corrupt politician.

621
45:16.000 --> 45:16.840
Ramil!

622
45:18.040 --> 45:20.360
Know your place.

623
45:20.960 --> 45:23.120
Everything you've had since childhood

624
45:23.200 --> 45:25.280
is because of me!

625
45:25.880 --> 45:27.640
If I hadn't taken care of you,

626
45:28.160 --> 45:29.920
you'd probably be a beggar by now.

627
45:30.000 --> 45:33.240
Or a drug runner or some junkie living on the streets.

628
45:33.320 --> 45:36.080
Show some gratitude for what I've done for you,

629
45:36.160 --> 45:37.520
parasite!

630
45:42.240 --> 45:43.120
Ramil!

631
45:45.880 --> 45:47.160
Why are you still here?

632
45:47.800 --> 45:51.680
Make your son apologize to me. Make him remember everything he owes me.

633
45:51.760 --> 45:53.960
Bring him here and make him kneel before me!

634
45:54.040 --> 45:55.760
I'm sorry on Ramil's behalf.

635
45:55.840 --> 45:58.560
Go! Bring him back and make him apologize. Go!

636
46:00.280 --> 46:01.480
Damn it.

637
46:03.920 --> 46:07.000
-Dad, I need to talk to you. -No more talking.

638
46:07.080 --> 46:08.640
And I'm not eating either!

639
46:14.560 --> 46:17.040
Ramil! Ramil!

640
46:18.520 --> 46:22.000
What Mr. Saksit did was because he wants what's best for you.

641
46:22.520 --> 46:25.320
We're all family. We have to help each other.

642
46:25.400 --> 46:27.720
If he really considered me part of this family,

643
46:28.560 --> 46:29.760
why can't I live here then?

644
46:31.920 --> 46:33.880
It's been over ten years

645
46:35.040 --> 46:36.880
since you divorced Dad

646
46:37.400 --> 46:38.840
and brought me here.

647
46:39.360 --> 46:42.560
Not once have I ever felt that he treated you

648
46:42.640 --> 46:44.640
with the respect a wife deserves.

649
46:45.160 --> 46:46.920
He just wanted someone to run the house,

650
46:47.600 --> 46:49.560
manage the servants,

651
46:50.480 --> 46:54.400
and raise Raiwin after his mother died.

652
46:55.680 --> 46:59.000
I'm not even sure he ever loved you.

653
46:59.080 --> 47:00.440
Maybe he just wanted a servant!

654
47:01.840 --> 47:02.920
Don't ever say that again.

655
47:05.880 --> 47:07.760
If Mr. Saksit hadn't helped us,

656
47:07.840 --> 47:10.720
where would we be living now? What kind of life would we have?

657
47:11.440 --> 47:15.440
I've never forgotten that he helped us. But Mom,

658
47:16.520 --> 47:18.400
we've served him long enough.

659
47:23.720 --> 47:26.280
Mom, I'm grown now.

660
47:27.640 --> 47:29.120
I can take care of you.

661
47:30.600 --> 47:32.160
Come live with me.

662
47:33.600 --> 47:34.440
Please, Mom.

663
47:40.840 --> 47:42.520
I can't be ungrateful to him.

664
47:50.840 --> 47:52.320
I don't understand, Mom.

665
47:53.120 --> 47:56.240
Why do you keep giving in to him? Why put up with living like this?!

666
48:00.320 --> 48:02.200
If you don't want to start the company,

667
48:02.720 --> 48:04.960
I respect your decision.

668
48:06.560 --> 48:08.960
But I want you to apologize to Mr. Saksit.

669
48:10.840 --> 48:12.560
If I'm wrong, I'll apologize.

670
48:14.400 --> 48:16.440
But I will never bow my head

671
48:16.960 --> 48:18.880
to someone who intends to steal.

672
48:36.800 --> 48:39.240
Make it even.

673
48:40.920 --> 48:42.800
Is something bothering you?

674
48:43.320 --> 48:45.480
If something's troubling you, you can tell me.

675
48:51.040 --> 48:53.520
I'm not trying to interfere in your business.

676
48:54.400 --> 48:57.720
I just don't want the workers to have to deal with your bad mood.

677
49:05.400 --> 49:06.600
Keep it up!

678
49:07.320 --> 49:08.440
You too!

679
49:13.240 --> 49:14.080
Hey, boss.

680
49:14.160 --> 49:18.040
I heard your mom invited you to eat at the main house.

681
49:18.120 --> 49:19.240
Was the food good?

682
49:28.800 --> 49:30.600
Why are you standing there?

683
49:30.680 --> 49:32.640
Don't you have work to do? Get back to work!

684
49:34.800 --> 49:36.520
You guys are in for a rough day.

685
49:46.160 --> 49:47.480
I started with 500,000

686
49:47.560 --> 49:50.080
and made 300,000 in just one night.

687
49:51.400 --> 49:54.200
If I take all 800,000 and play again,

688
49:54.720 --> 49:57.000
wouldn't I come back with more than a million?

689
50:13.920 --> 50:16.480
Every time you call, it's always about some mess,

690
50:16.560 --> 50:18.080
some problem I have to fix.

691
50:18.160 --> 50:20.200
You're selfish. How dare you

692
50:20.280 --> 50:21.040
‎NEXT EPISODE

693
50:21.120 --> 50:22.720
tell other people about my business?

694
50:22.800 --> 50:25.200
-You're talking about your father. -None of your business.

695
50:25.280 --> 50:28.000
Hot rice porridge is ready.

696
50:28.080 --> 50:30.800
The kitchen staff said Hathaya woke up late.

697
50:30.880 --> 50:32.760
I was worried about you, Grandpa,

698
50:32.840 --> 50:35.800
so I made you some rice porridge and prepared your medicine.

699
50:35.880 --> 50:37.520
As Subdistrict Chief here,

700
50:37.600 --> 50:40.080
when we move out, we will definitely have a place to live.

701
50:40.160 --> 50:41.200
No way!

702
50:41.280 --> 50:44.480
What were you thinking, risking your own life for them?!

703
51:40.560 --> 51:42.840
Subtitle translation by: Thanit Puncharoen
